    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d188">

                <pb facs="0276" n="254" xml:id="pg254"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">310.393/6–451: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Embassy in the United Kingdom
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-06-04T18:00:00-04:00">June 4, 1951—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5637. Pls deliver fol personal msg from SecState to Morrison:</p>
                <p>“I shld like to express my appreciation for your reply to my msg on the Chi
                    representation question in the UN, which has been
                    delivered by Reps of the Brit Emb here.</p>
                <p>“I am certain that, thru advance consultation between our Reps along the lines on
                    which we are now agreed, we can successfully dispose of this issue when it is
                    raised in UN bodies without undue difficulty and
                    without an undesirable and repeated airing of our differing views.</p>
                <p>“The position we shall now jointly support will be very helpful to us here and
                    will I know be well received by public opinion in this country.”</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
